# Safety for kids / family channels

- Mark content as made for kids when it is; no comment replies that collect personal info.
- No clickbait that frightens or misleads; titles stay literal and friendly.
- No real children's faces/names; no off-platform contact prompts.
- Keep scripts free of violence, scary imagery, and unsafe imitation (e.g. dangerous activities).
- Prefer original songs/characters; avoid copyrighted melodies or characters.
